  { question: "How quickly do cannabis topicals work?", answer: "Most users report feeling topical effects within 15–30 minutes of application, with peak effect at 1–2 hours, lasting 2–4 hours per application. Transdermal patches work over a longer sustained release (often 8–24 hours, depending on the patch). Individual results vary by product formulation, skin permeability, and body chemistry." },
