  <p class="disclaimer"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This guide is for educational purposes. It is not medical advice. Cannabis topicals are not FDA-approved to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. If you have a specific medical condition (skin condition, chronic pain, arthritis), talk to a licensed clinician before adding cannabis topicals to your regimen. Cannabis can interact with prescription medications metabolized by the CYP450 system. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, or subject to drug testing, talk to your doctor before using any cannabis product, including topicals.</p>
